# Hearthome's Poffin House (decomp scripts_poffin_common.s, applications/poffin_berry_selection, overlay083): the woman
# by the tables, COOK ALONE, the bag's berries (CONFIRM), the berry drops in and the cooking runs with Right held (the
# keys' stand-in for the stylus, stirring clockwise round the pot); RESULTS, the Poffin put away, "keep cooking?" NO.
# The Poffin's flavours follow the stirring (each seed rolls its own directions); its smoothness is the berry's less 1
# (a Cheri Berry's 25). The Poffin House reporter's data is the Poffin's type. The save keeps the Poffin.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_STARAVIA 20 platinum:MOVE_WING_ATTACK
give item platinum:ITEM_POFFIN_CASE 1
give item platinum:ITEM_CHERI_BERRY 2
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_POFFIN_HOUSE 5 11 up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until menu
+4 press a
+1 release a
until app bag
+0 assert state poffins []
+2 tap row:0
+2 tap menu:0
until app poffin-cooking 30
+0 assert state bag.berries [{"item":"platinum:ITEM_CHERI_BERRY","count":1}]
+120 screenshot poffin-drop
+30 press right
+300 screenshot poffin-stir
until state records.counts["52"] 1 2400
+0 release right
# RESULTS (rows, then the Poffin): A puts the Poffin away, A again asks "keep cooking?", B answers NO.
+80 screenshot poffin-results
+0 press a
+1 release a
until state poffins[0].smoothness 24 900
+10 press a
+1 release a
+10 press b
+1 release b
until app none 300
advance text
until idle
+0 assert state poffins[0].smoothness 24
+0 assert state tv.pending.poffin 27
# Out and back in: the house's resume script shows the TV reporter (the Poffin is pending, PoffinHouse_OnResume), so the
# reload keeps the state.
+0 press down
until position 5 12 120
+0 release down
until idle
+0 press right
until position 8 12 240
+0 release right
until idle
+0 press down
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_HEARTHOME_CITY" 300
+0 release down
until idle 300
+0 press up
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_POFFIN_HOUSE" 300
+0 release up
until idle 300
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert state poffins[0].smoothness 24
